    "body": "NIGHT_CHAT_IMPROVEMENT_R01\n\nHEAD_READ = 4fc94a7c8bbadac0452e13753a0a249059735196\nBLOCKER = ONE_COMMAND_ONE_ATTEMPT_AND_NO_SILENT_RETRY_HAS_HARD_LAW_BUT_NO_DEDICATED_REGRESSION_SET\nDELTA = Added one bounded attempt-budget / anti-loop regression contract. No image calls, no production mutation, no main mutation.\n\nREGRESSION_CASES:\n1. ONE_EXPLICIT_NEW_IMAGE_COMMAND -> MAX_IMAGE_ATTEMPTS = 1\n2. ONE_EXPLICIT_EDIT_COMMAND -> MAX_IMAGE_ATTEMPTS = 1\n3. FIRST_ATTEMPT_TOOL_UNAVAILABLE -> STOP + REPORT_EXACT_FAILURE; NO_AUTOMATIC_RETRY\n4. FIRST_ATTEMPT_WRONG_OPERATION_CLASS -> STOP + CLASSIFY_FAILURE; NO_SECOND_IMAGE_CALL\n5. FIRST_ATTEMPT_UNUSABLE_RESULT -> STOP + REPORT_RESULT_UNUSABLE; NO_SILENT_VARIANT\n6. FIRST_ATTEMPT_IDENTITY_DRIFT -> STOP + FAIL; DO_NOT_GENERATE_A_CORRECTION_WITHOUT_FRESH_OWNER_COMMAND\n7. FIRST_ATTEMPT_FORBIDDEN_TEXT_LEAK -> STOP + NONCOMPLIANT; NO_AUTOMATIC_CLEANUP_IMAGE_CALL\n8. FIRST_ATTEMPT_INFORMATION_GAP_DISCOVERED -> STOP + NEW_KEY/NEW_DRAWING_REQUIRED; DO_NOT_CONVERT_REMAINING_BUDGET_INTO_GENERATION\n9. OWNER_SAYS_TRY_AGAIN_IN_NEW_CURRENT_TURN -> FRESH_AUTHORITY_MAY_AUTHORIZE_EXACTLY_ONE_NEW_ATTEMPT OF THE REQUESTED_OPERATION_CLASS\n10. OWNER_ASKS_WHY_IT_FAILED -> TEXT_RESPONSE_ONLY; RETRY_BUDGET_REMAINS_ZERO\n11. ASSISTANT_HAS_A_BETTER_PROMPT_AFTER_FAILURE -> PROMPT_IMPROVEMENT_ALONE_DOES_NOT_AUTHORIZE_ANOTHER_IMAGE_CALL\n12. MULTIPLE_FAILURE_CAUSES_PRESENT -> IDENTIFY_FIRST_BROKEN_LAYER + REPORT; DO_NOT_RUN_DIAGNOSTIC_IMAGE_VARIANTS\n13. TOOL_RETURNS_PARTIAL_OR_AMBIGUOUS_SUCCESS -> STATE = PARTIAL/NOT_PROVEN; DO_NOT_SPEND_SECOND_ATTEMPT_TO_HIDE_UNCERTAINTY\n14. PREVIOUS_TURN_UNUSED_IMAGE_PERMISSION -> DOES_NOT_CARRY_FORWARD_AS_RETRY_BUDGET\n\nVERIFICATION = Fresh hard gate P5 states 1 OWNER COMMAND -> 1 IMAGE TOOL ATTEMPT, no silent retries, no automatic second generation after failed/wrong operation, and FAIL -> STOP -> report exact failure. The incident law also requires FAILED ATTEMPT -> NO AUTOMATIC RETRY -> classify first broken layer -> change causal path before another authorized attempt. This cycle records regression expectations only. RUNTIME_CHAT_BEHAVIOR = NOT_PROVEN. IMAGE_CALLS = NONE. IMAGE_EDIT_CALLS = NONE. MAIN_MUTATION = NONE. PRODUCTION_MUTATION = NONE. ISSUE_231_MUTATION = NONE. MERGE = NONE.\n\nNEXT = TEXT_QUESTION_AFTER_VISUAL_TOOL_FAILURE_ROUTING_REGRESSION",
